**PR Title:** `feat(conflicts): resolve concurrent heads via lexicographical CID comparison`
**Motivation:** Break ties between unlinked concurrent manifest heads deterministically by comparing their raw content identifier byte arrays.

```rust
pub fn break_tie_lexicographically(head_a: &Manifest, head_b: &Manifest) -> Manifest {
    if head_a.id().as_bytes() < head_b.id().as_bytes() {
        head_a.clone()
    } else {
        head_b.clone()
    }
}
```

