**PR Title:** `perf(staging): group staged operations by path in BTreeMap`
**Motivation:** Coalesce uncommitted operations by path in memory to simplify transaction replay.

```rust
pub fn coalesce_operations(operations: Vec<StagedOperation>) -> Vec<StagedOperation> {
    let mut by_path: BTreeMap<String, Vec<StagedOperation>> = BTreeMap::new();
    for op in operations {
        by_path.entry(op.path().to_string()).or_default().push(op);
    }
    by_path.into_values().flatten().collect()
}
```

